        ("In metrical scansion, an iambic foot consists of which rhythmic stress pattern?", ["An unstressed syllable followed by a stressed syllable (da-DUM)", "A stressed syllable followed by an unstressed syllable (DUM-da)", "Two stressed syllables (DUM-DUM)", "Two unstressed syllables followed by a stressed syllable"], 0, "An iamb is an unstressed-stressed metrical foot (e.g. 'to-DAY', 'a-RISE').", "Metrical Scansion"),
