        ("The running over of a sentence or thought from one poetic line into the next line without a terminal punctuation mark is:", ["Enjambment (Run-on line)", "End-stopping", "Caesura", "Volta"], 0, "Enjambment creates continuous rhythmic momentum across verse boundaries.", "Poetic Techniques"),
