        ("The dramatic moment in a tragedy when the protagonist experiences a sudden, decisive reversal of fortune from prosperity to ruin is:", ["Peripeteia", "Anagnorisis", "Denouement", "Exposition"], 0, "Peripeteia marks the turning point where the hero's circumstances plunge uncontrollably.", "Tragic Structure"),
